 	  is usually done in USI node in Device Tree.
 
+config EXYNOS8895_CPUPM
+	bool "Exynos8895 CPU power-down for cpuidle" if COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on CPU_PM
+	default ARCH_EXYNOS && ARM_PSCI_CPUIDLE
+	help
+	  Programs the per-core power configuration of the Exynos8895 PMU
+	  around PSCI idle states, so that idle cores are actually switched
+	  off. It can be turned off at runtime with the "enable" module
+	  parameter.
+
